_company:"CWI Software · Full-time",timeline_cwi_location:"Remote",timeline_cwi_bullet1:"Worked as a designer for a sustainable fintech project, focusing on internet banking and implementing Pix instant payments in both app and web platforms.",timeline_cwi_bullet2:"Sustained the internet banking platform design system, drafting user flows and customer journey maps for new products (Pix, cashback, and gift cards).",timeline_cwi_bullet3:"Conducted product discoveries to attract clients from telecommunications, digital media, and language education sectors.",timeline_freelance_date:"Mar 2019 - Nov 2020 · 1 yr 9 mos",timeline_freelance_title:"Product Designer",timeline_freelance_company:"Freelance · Freelance",timeline_freelance_location:"Rio Grande do Sul, Brazil · Remote",timeline_freelance_bullet1:"Developed digital products for clients across automotive, insurance, and healthcare industries.",timeline_freelance_bullet2:"Produced UX deliverables including benchmarks, personas, wireframes, user journeys, interface reviews, interface design, and usability tests.",timeline_freelance_bullet3:"Crafted interfaces in Adobe XD and Figma, and coded frontends using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React.",timeline_conceptu_pleno_date:"Feb 2018 - Feb 2019 · 1 yr 1 mo",timeline_conceptu_pleno_title:"Product Designer (UX / UI Designer) & Front-end Dev.",timeline_conceptu_pleno_company:"Conceptu Protótipos & Sistemas · Full-time",timeline_conceptu_pleno_location:"Porto Alegre Area · Hybrid",timeline_conceptu_pleno_bullet1:"Designed interfaces for mobile applications and web platforms.",timeline_conceptu_pleno_bullet2:"Created and maintained design systems to scale interface coherence.",timeline_conceptu_pleno_bullet3:"Conducted usability, responsiveness, and ecosystem coherence evaluations across corporate platforms.",timeline_prismatec_date:"Apr 2017 - Feb 2018 · 11 mos",timeline_prismatec_title:"Product Designer (UX / UI Designer)",timeline_prismatec_company:"Prismatec · Full-time",ti